# Unreal build output and caches (regenerated automatically)
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# Written by the cooker, not by us. Build/ itself is deliberately not ignored - it is where a
# platform icon or a hand-made build setting would live - but these two are generated and churn
# on every cook. They appeared the first time the project was packaged, 2026-11-02.
Build/*/FileOpenOrder/

# Written by the editor the first time an asset editor is opened, 2026-11-03. It is 57 KB of
# AdvancedPreviewScene.SharedProfiles - the lighting setup for the little preview viewport in the
# material and mesh editors. It holds no project setting, changes nothing in the game or the cook,
# and churns whenever the editor feels like it. If a real [CookSettings] or editor preference ever
# needs to be checked in, delete this line and commit the file deliberately.
Config/DefaultEditor.ini

# Visual Studio / Rider project files (regenerated from the .uproject)
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# OS clutter
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Pillow, installed next to Tools/make_brand.py by its own pip line. A dependency, not source.
Tools/pylibs/
